   "kind": "concept",
   "body": "Coefficients out front multiply separately: 2√3 · 4√2 = (2 · 4)√(3 · 2) = 8√6. Multiply the outside numbers together, and the inside numbers together — two independent multiplications.",
   "figure": "rad-multiply"
  },
  {
   "id": "i2",
   "kind": "interactive",
